```mermaid
%% Compact slide-friendly activity diagram
%% Use init to reduce node/rank spacing and a small font class
%%{init: {"theme":"base","flowchart": {"nodeSpacing": 20, "rankSpacing": 20, "curve":"basis"}, "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "10px", "fontFamily": "arial"}}}%%
flowchart TD
  classDef small font-size:10px,font-family:arial;

  Start([Start]) --> Create[Create]
  Create --> Valid{Valid?}
  subgraph Flow1
    Valid -->|yes| Save[Save]
    Valid -->|no| Error[Error]
    Save --> Notify[Notify]
  end
  subgraph Flow2
    Notify --> Update[Update]
    Update --> Views[Views]
  end
  subgraph Flow3
    Views --> Loop{Done?}
    Loop -->|no| Status[Update]
    Loop -->|yes| Done[Complete]
    Status --> Loop
  end

  class Start,Create,Save,Error,Notify,Update,Views,Status,Done small
  
  %% Adjust layout to be more compact with 3:4 ratio

